-<!DOCTYPE html>
-<html>
-<head>
-    <title>CSS Test: Shape outside and repeating linear gradient</title>
-    <link rel="author" title="Alan Stearns" href="mailto:stearns@adobe.com"/>
-    <link rel="help" href="http://www.w3.org/TR/css-shapes-1/#shapes-from-image"/>
